# R3 golden: an unterminated string swallows the rest of the file, so the
# parser fails at end of file. The reported location must be the END of the
# original file (line 9:1 here: eight lines plus the final newline), not line 1:1. On v169 both normal mode and
# --check printed 1:1, because the EOF token lies one byte past the
# flattened source, where the origin map has no entry.
mukhya() {
    likha("unfinished)
}
